{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FkLCSE62wBBoBqFBcr8wW3","type":"tool_result","content":"analysis.py\ncodebook.md\ndata.csv\nfinal_answer.json\nreport.md\n# Codebook\n\nUnit: one row per firm (2000 manufacturing and service firms). Cross-section.\n\n| column | description |\n|---|---|\n| firm_id | Firm identifier |\n| training_hours | Average annual training hours per employee, 2021-2022 |\n| productivity_2023 | Value added per employee in 2023 (thousand USD) |\n| log_employees_2020 | Log number of employees, 2020 |\n| firm_age_2020 | Firm age in years, standardized, 2020 |\n| productivity_2020 | Value added per employee in 2020, standardized |\n| mgmt_rating_2023 | Management practices rating collected in 2023 survey |\n| region | Region (north, central, south) |\n| listed | 1 if publicly listed |\n| sector | Sector: manufacturing / services |\n| export_share_2020 | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n| foreign_owned | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n| family_owned | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n| rd_intensity_2020 | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n| union_share_2020 | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n| credit_score_2020 | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n# Report\n\nQuestion: What is the effect of employee training hours on firm productivity?\n\nApproach: OLS of productivity_2023 on training_hours with heteroskedasticity-robust (HC1) standard errors. I control for firm size and firm age and trim the top and bottom 1% of the outcome.\n\nResult: the coefficient on training_hours is 0.954 (SE 0.226, p = 0.0000, N = 1960).\n\nConclusion: positive effect.\n\nSpecifications estimated: 1 (the one above). Code: analysis.py.\n{\n \"conclusion\": \"positive effect\",\n \"estimate\": 0.9536,\n \"std_error\": 0.2261,\n \"p_value\": 2e-05,\n \"n_specifications_estimated\": 1,\n \"preferred_specification\": \"controls=size_age; sample=all; outcome=level; trim=1%\"\n}firm_id,training_hours,productivity_2023,log_employees_2020,firm_age_2020,productivity_2020,mgmt_rating_2023,region,listed,sector,export_share_2020,foreign_owned,family_owned,rd_intensity_2020,union_share_2020,credit_score_2020\n1,-0.4401,104.208,-0.0789,0.4225,0.416,-2.1325,south,0,manufacturing,1.0089,1.0,-0.1368,1.0,2.0823,0.6401\n2,-1.2295,80.445,-0.4239,-0.6573,0.6865,-4.444,central,0,manufacturing,-2.0889,0.0,-0.5843,0.0,1.3929,-2.1318\n3,-0.4855,129.078,1.571,1.9106,-0.7149,2.1445,north,0,services,0.4812,0.0,-0.1468,0.0,1.1363,0.4807\n4,-0.9502,77.307,-1.0734,1.6122,-0.6662,-0.687,north,0,services,-0.1548,0.0,0.8505,1.0,-1.614,0.1892\nanalysis.py","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"65d2e7aa-a7d1-4d11-b189-fc3d046538b8","uuid":"0b5f1b29-bb91-42b3-8654-81c0e3e5a24f"}
